# Spreading Seas on Bot2's Mutavault. "When this Aura enters, draw a card" (CR 603.6a): Bot1's hand goes from 5 (after the
# cast) to 6. "Enchanted land is an Island" sets the land's subtype (CR 305.7, layer 4): Mutavault loses its rules text's
# abilities - "{T}: Add {C}" and the animation - and has "{T}: Add {U}" (CR 305.6). Bot2 can tap it for {U} only. Before the
# Aura, Bot2 animates it (the positive control of the abilities being there).

